      "color": "#e57373",
      "intro": [
        "Traditional networks were built for the office.",
        "Cloud and remote work broke the perimeter."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a2",
      "label": "Act 2 · SD-WAN Foundation",
      "color": "#01a982",
      "intro": [
        "SD-WAN replaces MPLS with intelligent overlay.",
